{"id": "34470", "title": "钵兰", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34470.htm", "intro": "她会不会是误闯了恶魔窝？不过因为饿昏头想偷吃一口他的菜，这暴烈主人竟以砚台、纸镇轮番朝她问候，喂！帮个忙，别丢那可爱的女陶俑……慢了半拍，恼得古玩疯的她失控脱口驯兽，但报应果真随后跟到，她成了他这伤残五爷的专属出气丫鬟，早也吼，晚也吼，勤练嗓门拚命吼，这不对，那也错，猛挑毛病死命催，唉！不是她故意跟他过不去，明明他被火神咬伤的是一条腿，怎么天天张嘴打响雷……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34470", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2187518.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2187519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2187520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2187521.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2187522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2187523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2187524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2187525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2187526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2187527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2187528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2187529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2187530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2187531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2187532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2187533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2187534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2187535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2187536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2187537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2187538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2187539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2187540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2187541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2187542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26页",